    "Author": " (github-actions[bot])",
    "Description": "## Changes\r\n\r\n## 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- refactor: reorganize console output @olblak (#10876)\r\n- feat: various udash cleanup @olblak (#10831)\r\n- perf: speed up org-wide sweeps and the e2e suite @loispostula (#10706)\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- fix(httpclient): don't resend a write that may have reached the server @olblak (#10950)\r\n- fix(httpclient): honour Retry-After and rate limit reset headers @olblak (#10949)\r\n- fix(github): commit file deletions when using commitUsingApi @flavio (#10946)\r\n- fix(terraform/lock): record every platform hash on OpenTofu registry @loispostula (#10851)\r\n- fix(gitlab): stop deriving the client rate limit from response headers @olblak (#10878)\r\n- fix(git): fetch working branch with singlebranch and commitusingapi @mallendem (#10822)\r\n\r\n## 🧰 Maintenance\r\n\r\n- fix: add golangci-lint rule to catch httpclient usage @olblak (#10877)\r\n- deps(golang): Bump minor version for Golang module @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10943)\r\n- deps: Bump Golang version to 1.27.3 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10933)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/fluxcd/helm-controller/api to v1.6.5 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10926)\r\n- test(maven): isolate HOME to stop tests reading ~/.m2/settings.xml @lemeurherve (#10875)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/drone/go-scm to v1.42.19 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10918)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/fluxcd/source-controller/api to v1.9.6 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10913)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/moby/buildkit to v0.34.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10908)\r\n- chore(ci): upgrade uv version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10897)\r\n- chore(dockerfile): upgrade node version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10889)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 to v5.19.3 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10887)\r\n- fix: update github.com/minamijoyo/tfupdate to v0.10.2 @olblak (#10852)\r\n- deps: Bump Golang version to 1.27.2 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10847)\r\n- deps: update golangci-lint to v2.14.0 @olblak (#10838)\r\n- deps(go): bump module golang.org/x/net to v0.60.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10824)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/beevik/etree to v1.8.1 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10815)\r\n- deps(golang): Bump minor version for Golang module @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10811)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/ProtonMail/go-crypto to v1.5.2 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10804)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/drone/go-scm to v1.42.18 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10798)\r\n- deps(go): bump module helm.sh/helm/v3 to v3.22.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10791)\r\n- deps: bump Updatecli GH action to v3.9.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10782)\r\n- deps(github/action): bump all dependencies @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10772)\r\n- chore(dockerfile): upgrade node version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10738)\r\n- chore(ci): upgrade uv version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10739)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/hashicorp/hcl/v2 to v2.25.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10737)\r\n- deps: bump Updatecli GH action to v0.122.1 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10717)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/jferrl/go-githubauth to v1.9.1 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10703)\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n\r\n@flavio, @lemeurherve, @loispostula, @mallendem, @olblak, [@updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot), @PhantomPixelDev and @prajaktaukirde\r\n\r\n## Sponsors\r\n\r\nIf Updatecli is useful to you, please consider sponsoring it.  \r\nYour support helps maintain and improve this project.\r\n\r\n[![GitHub stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/updatecli/updatecli?style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli) [![Sponsor](https://img.shields.io/badge/Sponsor-%E2%9D%A4-pink?style=for-the-badge)](https://www.updatecli.io/support/#sponsor-or-donate)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
